WEBVTT

00:00.120 --> 00:01.520
But now

00:02.080 --> 00:03.480
Military command is not in my hands

00:03.600 --> 00:05.640
I have three hundred brothers under me

00:05.720 --> 00:07.080
Willing to die

00:08.600 --> 00:10.000
Under me

00:10.160 --> 00:11.760
Also over a hundred men

00:11.840 --> 00:13.240
Together

00:14.840 --> 00:16.440
At most only about five hundred

00:16.520 --> 00:18.080
Five hundred it is

00:18.520 --> 00:20.520
Five hundred men strike first

00:20.800 --> 00:23.480
As long as we control Chen Ying and the main camp

00:23.560 --> 00:25.320
Then everything will be fine

00:25.600 --> 00:27.480
Beishuo Army was built by Your Highness

00:27.560 --> 00:28.520
If it really comes to fighting

00:28.640 --> 00:30.640
We'll definitely put Your Highness first

00:31.280 --> 00:33.160
Willing to die for Your Highness
